  "consolidated_heads": {
    "B49a.1": {
      "change": "every ticket is held as a 64-bit value (LastOrderTicket, LastDealTicket, LastBuyTicket, LastSellTicket are long; the four (int) casts are gone), so a ticket above INT_MAX is never truncated",
      "pr": "algogoat/GOAT-EA#263 (claude-pc/b49a-tickets)",
      "coordination": "algogoat/goatai#2587 (WEEKEND-1031, 6427654059 / 6427772701)"
    },
    "B49a.2": {
      "change": "B48: a live chart rewrites its own CID GlobalVariable once per UTC day (the value it read; skipped on a failed read or a value <= 0; flushed after a successful write; retried after 60 s), so MT5's 4-week expiry never drops a running chart's record",
      "pr": "algogoat/GOAT-EA#264 (claude-pc/b49a-b48)",
      "coordination": "algogoat/goatai#2587 (WEEKEND-1031, 6427654059 / 6427772701)"
    },
    "B49a.3": {
      "change": "F2: the appended input Ledger_Mode (default Ledger_Legacy = B47). Ledger_PositionJoin books an exit by the position it closes (positions this sequence opened under MAGIC1), with fees, in the daily P/L, the dashboard rebuild and the transaction path; closes carry MAGIC1. The controller completes an omitted Ledger_Mode with its default; the Studio accepts it only at 0",
      "pr": "algogoat/GOAT-EA#265 (claude-pc/b49a-f2)",
      "coordination": "algogoat/goatai#2587 (WEEKEND-1031, 6427654059 / 6427772701)"
    },
    "B49a.4": {
      "change": "F1-lite: each live real sequence keeps a restart record (GlobalVariables, flushed); on OnInit an open basket whose record matches is adopted manage-only (sizes, the tightest broker SL, the level count and, under PositionJoin, realized P/L from history); stops are only ever tightened; adds stay frozen until the basket ends. Live charts only",
      "pr": "algogoat/GOAT-EA#266 (claude-pc/b49a-f1lite)",
      "coordination": "algogoat/goatai#2587 (WEEKEND-1031, 6427654059 / 6427772701)"
    }
  },
  "change": "B47 plus WEEKEND-1031: B49a.1 64-bit tickets, B49a.2 the B48 daily CID touch, B49a.3 F2 Ledger_Mode (position-join ledger, default Legacy = B47), B49a.4 F1-lite restart adoption (manage-only). Every changed line since B47 is marked B49a (scripts/test_b49a_no_drift.cjs); the input header gains the appended Ledger_Mode, so B49a batch packages carry its own header pin. Restart adoption and the CID touch run on live charts only.",
  "supersedes_candidate": "beta17-B47",
